            "text": "The baseline suite has one failure: the existing SysEx parsing test. The reproduction also fails for integer fields and empty SysEx data.\n\nI’ll fix the swapped branches and make `_parse_data` handle both the documented parenthesized form and your bare comma-separated form without stripping bytes. I’ll add regression tests for those cases, malformed data, and numeric validation.\n"
